# Kept out of the published package: the Wise installer and autorun programs with their unpacked
# third-party payloads, and the publisher's promotional catalogue. Their analysis (decompiled/,
# inventory/, extracted/wise-scripts/) is included.
original-game-decompiled/original/disc/Install.exe
original-game-decompiled/original/disc/Autorun.EXE
original-game-decompiled/original/disc/AUTORUN.INF
original-game-decompiled/original/disc/CATALOG/
